[{"title":"旅怀","author":"陈镒","text":"风雪岁将晚，客行犹未休。\n山前沽浊酒，江上发孤舟。\n杳杳飞云远，栖栖去雁愁。\n归欤是何日，生理在林丘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17510,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵月明德经历游茅山冷泉涧","author":"陈镒","text":"荦确山中径，徐行暂卸鞍。\n藓青粘屐冷，松翠滴衣单。\n石窦留云湿，岩泉泻月寒。\n语来天已夕，归步向盘跚。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17511,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵道元上人岁晚二首 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"山踪迷落叶，天气正深冬。\n崖雨添寒瀑，溪云向晚舂。\n客凭临水阁，僧叩隔林钟。\n倚杖无馀事，招猿下碧松。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17512,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵道元上人岁晚二首 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"地偏人迹罕，境寂自无哗。\n云湿松窗砚，风清竹屋茶。\n石梁融雪液，山沼落泉花。\n臈近寒梅发，相看鬓易华。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17513,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"病起述怀二首 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"居闲无世虑，块独守吾庐。\n病起方除药，行来暂阅书。\n秋花慰岑寂，老发任萧疏。\n何事驰驱者，无心赋遂初。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17514,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"病起述怀二首 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"溪边成小隐，竹里结茅庐。\n养鹤忧无料，盟鸥喜有书。\n山深寒到早，门静客来疏。\n风俗饶淳朴，游心太古初。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17515,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵荅杨文学","author":"陈镒","text":"江湖成久客，归思忽然生。\n富贵非吾愿，交游亦世情。\n头颅今已老，生计尚无营。\n一舸沧洲外，梅花兴自清。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17516,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"武陵送友人之维扬","author":"陈镒","text":"西浙同为客，维扬子独游。\n持杯酌别酒，挂席促行舟。\n夜月千灯市，春风十里楼。\n琼花正堪赏，到日却迟留。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17517,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"丙戌元旦客中","author":"陈镒","text":"开门春满室，旅况尚凄凉。\n椒柏迎新岁，萍蓬在异乡。\n历头忘检阅，贺客少迎将。\n独有高堂念，今晨阻奉觞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17518,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"重游南明山佛日寺","author":"陈镒","text":"重到南山寺，清凉一壑风。\n慧光明佛日，梵语隐天宫。\n岩洞留云在，池泉与海通。\n三平人去后，石虎势穹窿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17519,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵叶子西","author":"陈镒","text":"万山秋欲尽，邂逅古城中。\n霜径寒花晚，风林落叶空。\n笑谈情自厚，酬和句难工。\n明日还分手，看君马首东。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17520,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵春夕旅怀","author":"陈镒","text":"此身同倦翮，暂托一枝安。\n山近春常雨，溪深夜更寒。\n灯花频剪落，香篆暗烧残。\n明日寻归路，松阴满石阑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17521,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵郊居","author":"陈镒","text":"细水黄泥路，空山白板门。\n一身安畎亩，万事信乾坤。\n架上旧书满，瓮头新酒浑。\n小儿能采药，粗可给晨昏。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17522,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"饯别杨贯道山长归钱唐","author":"陈镒","text":"杨生别我去，故国在天涯。\n野店投鞭早，江?系缆迟。\n行装无长物，吟卷有新诗。\n留取怀中橘，还家慰母思。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17523,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"己丑九月抵金华旅馆和旧题诗韵","author":"陈镒","text":"冉冉岁华换，悠悠道路长。\n老来兼病肺，秋末尚殊方。\n池水荷衣尽，林霜橘子黄。\n故园何日返，已负菊花觞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17524,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"旅愁","author":"陈镒","text":"莽莽深春雨，江花落渐多。\n客舟偏阻滞，兵甲屡经过。\n深逝鱼惊椮，高飞鸟避罗。\n伤怀逢世乱，吾道竟如何。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17525,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵同友人宿山家","author":"陈镒","text":"偶然逢故友，携手玉山西。\n涧水穿林响，崖云压树低。\n东风楝花老，落日子规啼。\n共宿松窗夜，篝灯和旧题。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17526,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠常悦道","author":"陈镒","text":"老年豪气在，衰发已盈簪。\n时扫先亲墓，难忘孝子心。\n奚囊兼贮易，行李只携琴。\n莫问穷通事，相逢酒满斟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe529