四","author":"陈镒","text":"木叶萧萧下，哀蛩石上鸣。\n鬓毛衰易白，胸次郁难平。\n听雨添乡思，看云识世情。\n沉吟多感慨，搔首立前荣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17545,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"再次韵 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"未嫌官舍冷，秋色颇佳哉。\n有客论文坐，无人载酒来。\n疏阴凉叶陨，急景候虫催。\n吟罢闲延伫，长廊日影回。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17546,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"再次韵 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"蔌蔌夕风起，轻寒生薄裘。\n数峰林外晚，独树水边秋。\n世事萍无定，此身云共浮。\n据林一长啸，还忆庾公楼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17547,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"再次韵 其三","author":"陈镒","text":"晚景颇好道，寸心孤月明。\n山川游宦况，松菊故园情。\n辽渺天难问，艰危事屡更。\n倚阑生远思，云外暮鸿鸣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17548,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"再次韵 其四","author":"陈镒","text":"凉气渐凄肃，吟风黄叶鸣。\n闲庭多雨积，秋草与阶平。\n久为伤时乱，都忘玩物情。\n儒官粗堪守，勇爵是浮荣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17549,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"三用韵荅松学诸友 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"此地三年客，登临亦快哉。\n幸无官长骂，喜有故人来。\n把酒捲帘坐，吟诗击钵催。\n蟾峰青楚楚，时见鹤飞回。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17550,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"三用韵荅松学诸友 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"牢落风尘际，天寒一弊裘。\n看来官独冷，赢得鬓添秋。\n树润烟光合，池深水气浮。\n乡心日夜切，戍鼓起城楼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17551,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"三用韵荅松学诸友 其三","author":"陈镒","text":"水色循阶碧，山光入牖明。\n客稀无俗事，地僻有幽情。\n但得亲朋厚，何惭主仆更。\n随时聊自遣，忧乐以诗鸣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17552,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"三用韵荅松学诸友 其四","author":"陈镒","text":"万木渐摇落，凉风策策鸣。\n客愁惊老大，世乱念升平。\n虽忝官曹列，难忘丘壑情。\n故园频入梦，松菊想敷荣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17553,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽项学斋","author":"陈镒","text":"相聚今三载，交情只似初。\n艰难逢乱世，辛苦卜幽居。\n得米时沽酒，分灯夜看书。\n老成零落尽，吾道复何如。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17554,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"早过湖南","author":"陈镒","text":"湖月娟娟在，衣寒怯早行。\n水边孤鹤起，郊外乱鸡鸣。\n牢落身将老，艰危世未平。\n何当谢尘鞅，归傍白云耕。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17555,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵简周济川山长二首 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"故人辞薄宦，去隐白云乡。\n溪树春天晚，山泉夜月凉。\n携家怜杜甫，齐物忆蒙庄。\n知尔身和世，于今亦两忘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17556,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵简周济川山长二首 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"白首频遭乱，其如造物何。\n纵鳞乘骇浪，病鹤托脩柯。\n别友岁年久，怀人梦寐多。\n扁舟须过我，沽酒听渔歌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17557,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄友人","author":"陈镒","text":"怜君来此隐，竟日掩岩扉。\n山晚碧云合，溪深黄叶飞。\n干戈虽暂息，乡国未能归。\n想见行吟处，寒波澹落晖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17558,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽道元上人二首 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"久玩林泉月，今乘古峡风。\n身遗万劫永，道悟一尘空。\n寒竹留枯节，幽花落旧丛。\n惟馀行诵处，山意远无穷。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17559,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽道元上人二首 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"元公今殁去，令我独怀思。\n经罢惟谈道，禅馀不废诗。\n云巢孤鹤守，石洞断猿悲。\n寂寞烧香室，窗寒白月迟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17560,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和吴伯京学正立春见寄韵","author":"陈镒","text":"我已多衰病，君今亦老成。\n闭门惊腊尽，把酒及春生。\n但愿兵戈息，从无爵禄荣。\n郡斋风月好，吟咏足幽情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17561,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拜故参政石末公祠堂","author":"陈镒","text":"一代名臣录，公应作首推。\n功勋家有集，忠义主深知。\n海右戍今已，人间病不治。\n瓣香千古意，遗庙草离离。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17562,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉题按察使诗卷","author":"陈镒","text":"使臣持玉节，南国动春容。\n古驿梨花白，荒城柳叶浓。\n居官无酷吏，在野有耕农。\n明日回骢马，苍山云万重。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17563,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠周山长","author":"陈镒","text":"岁暮犹行役，风霜袭缊袍。\n幸无嫌酒薄，聊尔助诗豪。\n世事皆前定，人生谩自劳。\n功名如可取，端合付儿曹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17564,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和吴学正见寄韵二首 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"一从相别后，寄迹各东西。\n岁月身惟老，风尘眼欲迷。\n依山松径窈，临水草堂低。\n独坐相思夜，凄凉月满溪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17565,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和吴学正见寄韵二首 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"不见故人久，悠然多所思。\n郡斋呼茗椀，山馆理桐丝。\n望断云凝处，吟残叶落时。\n风霜岁年晚，还共竹猗猗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17566,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题买从道枯木石图","author":"陈镒","text":"寂历何年树，槎牙傍水村。\n霜风吹叶尽，秋色落云根。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17567,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵","author":"陈镒","text":"老去头添雪，愁来眼著花。\n清尊不成釂，闲坐到昏鸦。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17568,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怀张应奉","author":"陈镒","text":"故人千里外，相见一何难。\n几度裁书尺，秋云雁影寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17569,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"野步","author":"陈镒","text":"随意踏春沙，缘塍度菜花。\n偶逢溪叟语，行到野人家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17570,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵过湖南竹林","author":"陈镒","text":"一径入深寂，森然万琅玕。\n日暮雪欲落，翠袖生薄寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17571,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题草堂晚景图","author":"陈镒","text":"远水涵碧波，重山敛暝色。\n琴客期未来，草堂新月白。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17572,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题方泳道县尹竹石图","author":"陈镒","text":"潇洒数尺篁，孱颜一拳石。\n开卷清风生，凛然见寒碧。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17573,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"客中九日 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"客居邻小市，有酒有黄花。\n莫讶无诗友，故乡天一涯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17574,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"客中九日 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"今晨风落帽，秋鬓觉苍苍。\n小酌聊成醉，都忘在异乡。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17575,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"偶题","author":"陈镒","text":"小亭环绿筠，潇洒宜宴坐。\n是中宾主谁，明月清风我。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17576,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晚兴","author":"陈镒","text":"野兴遂幽讨，独行河水湄。\n平原忽空旷，蝉声在高枝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17577,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"渡江","author":"陈镒","text":"残月晓犹在，微茫水气凉。\n潮来风满棹，送客过钱塘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17578,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"病起夜坐二首 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"独坐寒窗夜，深炉火欲灰。\n无穷身外事，都逐雨声来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17579,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"病起夜坐二首 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"自怜衰老貌，灯影雪千茎。\n药饵扶吾病，诗书寄此生。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17580,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"明旦再用前韵 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"杜门聊守拙，利禄念俱灰。\n旧雨曾来客，如今雨不来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17581,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"明旦再用前韵 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"古鼎烧香篆，朝盘荐菜茎。\n澹然闲自适，何用学吾生。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17582,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]